    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<h3>The connection between the name ZOLLER and the team of over 800 people, numerous innovations, and the down-to-earth nature of a family-owned business is strong.</h3>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c718",
      "bg": "",
      "space": {
       "before": "default",
       "after": "default"
      }
     }
    ],
    [
     {
      "type": "textmedia",
      "header": "",
      "body": "<p><strong>Outstanding precision, simple operation, and high quality—these characteristics define our products and drive our actions. The foundation for this is our team of more than 800 employees in 62 countries. They represent an especially diverse range of skills, ideas, ways of thinking and approaches, cultures, and languages. The value of this diversity for our corporate culture and growth potential cannot be overstated. </strong></p> <p>We see ourselves as a globally-minded, technology-oriented family-owned company. Our roots lie in the down-to-earth nature of small and medium-sized businesses, and our growth is based on interaction, innovation, and a willingness to shape progress.</p> <p>ZOLLER is present wherever machining, toolmaking, and tool grinding are key economic factors. We offer a globally unique system comprising measuring technology, inspection technology, tool management, software, and automation. This system makes every manufacturing process more efficient. </p> <p>ZOLLER customers come from all industries in which machining processes and cutting tools make a significant contribution to value creation. These include, for example, the automotive, aerospace, medical technology, mechanical engineering, plant engineering, and mold making sectors.</p>",
      "images": [],
      "videos": [],
      "pos": "text",
      "cols": 1,
      "valign": "top",
      "ftype": "text",
      "id": "c719",
